# Evocation spell names + descriptions.
spell-acid_splash = Acid Splash
spell-acid_splash-desc = Hurl a tiny orb of caustic fluid that bursts at a chosen point, spattering everyone nearby. Those caught in the splash take searing acid damage unless they dodge clear.
spell-booming_blade = Booming Blade
spell-booming_blade-desc = The caster wreaths a melee weapon in humming resonance and strikes a foe within reach. The blow rings with crashing sound, jolting the target with a concussive shock.
spell-eldritch_blast = Eldritch Blast
spell-eldritch_blast-desc = Crackling threads of raw energy lance from the caster's fingertips toward chosen foes. Each requires a precise ranged strike and scorches its target with pure force.
spell-frostbite = Frostbite
spell-frostbite-desc = A bite of numbing frost crystallizes over a single creature, sapping its strength. A target that fails to steel itself takes cold damage.
spell-green_flame_blade = Green-Flame Blade
spell-green_flame_blade-desc = The wielder swings an enchanted weapon, and on contact emerald fire erupts from the wound. The flames then leap to a second foe standing close beside the first, searing them as well.
spell-lightning_lure = Lightning Lure
spell-lightning_lure-desc = A crackling tether of electricity snaps out toward a nearby foe, yanking them closer when it bites. The lash sears them with lightning on contact.
spell-shocking_grasp = Shocking Grasp
spell-shocking_grasp-desc = A jolt of crackling current leaps from your palm into a foe you reach out to touch. The shock sears the body and snarls their nerves.
spell-sorcerous_burst = Sorcerous Burst
spell-sorcerous_burst-desc = The caster hurls a coil of raw magical energy at a single creature or object, requiring a ranged spell attack to strike true. The energy manifests as searing acid when it lands.
spell-starry_wisp = Starry Wisp
spell-starry_wisp-desc = You fling a glimmering mote of starlight at a single foe, searing it with radiant power.
spell-thunderclap = Thunderclap
spell-thunderclap-desc = The caster claps their hands to unleash a concussive crack of sound that ripples outward, battering every nearby creature with a wave of thunder. Those who fail to brace against the shock take the brunt of the blast.
spell-word_of_radiance = Word of Radiance
spell-word_of_radiance-desc = Speaking a sacred word, the caster releases a flash of searing light that scorches chosen foes nearby. Those who steel their bodies against the glare take less of the burning brilliance.
spell-caustic_brew = Caustic Brew
spell-caustic_brew-desc = A searing jet of corrosive fluid sprays outward in a long, narrow swath. Those caught in its path are doused in clinging acid that keeps eating away at them until they scrape it off.
spell-chaos_bolt = Chaos Bolt
spell-chaos_bolt-desc = The caster flings a churning knot of unstable energy at a single foe, resolved with a ranged spell attack. The mote's element shifts unpredictably each time it strikes.
spell-divine_favor = Divine Favor
spell-divine_favor-desc = A halo of sacred light wreathes your weapon, so your next blow sears the target with searing radiance.
spell-earth_tremor = Earth Tremor
spell-earth_tremor-desc = The caster slams a fist of will against the earth, and the ground bucks violently outward in a short radius. Everything caught in the quake is battered by churning stone unless it scrambles clear in time.
spell-frost_fingers = Frost Fingers
spell-frost_fingers-desc = A sudden gale of biting cold erupts from the caster's outstretched hand, sheeting everything before it in frost. Those caught in the blast endure searing chill unless they steel their bodies against it.
spell-hellish_rebuke = Hellish Rebuke
spell-hellish_rebuke-desc = In answer to a foe's blow, you fling a sudden gout of punishing flame at the one who struck you. The target attempts to dodge, taking searing fire damage that is lessened if it twists aside.
spell-spellfire_flare = Spellfire Flare
spell-spellfire_flare-desc = A searing bolt of holy fire streaks toward a foe, requiring a ranged spell attack to strike true. The radiant blaze burns so fiercely that little offers real protection from it.
spell-wayward_force_darts = Wayward Force Darts
spell-wayward_force_darts-desc = The caster flings several darts of pure force in rapid succession, each one streaking unerringly toward the same mark and battering it in a short, brutal volley.
